OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 19 MAR
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GElizabeth Alker showcases the
OL,11,     Gbest performances from the UK and
OL,12,     Gbeyond, including Rachmaninov's
OL,13,     GPiano Concerto No.3 from Isata
OL,14,     GKanneh-Mason and opera without
OL,15,     Gwords from Rameau.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Donizetti
OL,17,     GDonald Macleod follows the
OL,18,     Girresistible rise of Italian
OL,19,     Gopera composer Gaetano Donizetti.
OL,20,     GToday, a new chapter for
OL,21,     GDonizetti as he moves to Paris in
OL,22,     Gsearch of artistic freedom.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
