OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 19 MAR
OL,4,G1700FIn Tune
OL,5,     GLive performance by Anna
OL,6,     GLowenstein and her quartet to
OL,7,     Gpromote their album Through The
OL,8,     GWalls. Susan Tomes talks to Katie
OL,9,     Gabout her new book Nocturnes and
OL,10,     Gthe Fascination of Night.
OL,11,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,12,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,13,     Gsoundscape of classical music
OL,14,     Gincluding works by Amy Beach,
OL,15,     GVilla-Lobos, Debussy, Malcolm
OL,16,     GArnold, and Adolphus Hailstork
OL,17,     Gamongst others.
