OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 19 MAR
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GSoweto's guest Naissam Jalal is
OL,12,     Gback to share her fourth and
OL,13,     Gfinal jazz album pick for
OL,14,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,15,     GAlban Gerhardt performs the Cello
OL,16,     GConcerto by Mieczyslaw Weinberg
OL,17,     Gwith the RTVE Symphony Orchestra
OL,18,     Gin Madrid. Prokofiev's Fifth
OL,19,     GSymphony completes the programme.
